{"id":"unangenehm","lemma":"unangenehm","pos":"adv","rank":2429,"glosses":["unpleasantly"],"ipa":"/ˈʊn.anɡəˌneːm/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d8/De-unangenehm.ogg/De-unangenehm.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Was folgte, war unangenehm.","en":"What followed was unpleasant.","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"to follow","l":"folgen"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Sie sagen, wenn das unangenehm ist.","en":"Please let me know if you feel uncomfortable.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to say (to pronounce"},{"g":"if / when"},{"g":"the / that"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"}]},{"text":"Ich finde es unangenehm, das zu tun.","en":"I find doing that disagreeable.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to find","l":"finden"},{"g":"it"},null,{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to do"}]},{"text":"Diese Frucht riecht unangenehm.","en":"This fruit has an unpleasant smell.","words":[{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},{"g":"fruit"},{"g":"to smell","l":"riechen"},null]},{"text":"Er hatte eine unangenehm kreischende Stimme.","en":"He had an unpleasant screechy voice.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"a"},null,null,{"g":"voice"}]}]}